  "description": "DocX is a .NET library that allows developers to manipulate Microsoft Word files, in an easy and intuitive manner. DocX is fast, lightweight and best of all it does not require Microsoft Word or Office to be installed. v2.5.0 provides 11 bug fixes and improvements. Check out the professional edition, known as Xceed Words for .NET, on Xceed.com. It includes technical support, offer more features and options, and can create PDF files as well as convert Word files to PDF files.",
